comments.body:
@Andre Lustosa Cabral de Paula Motta audited this list of RPMs.
We cannot build any of the RPMs here due to lack of source code availability, however these RPMs are all already mirrored at https://private.console.redhat.com/api/pulp-content/rhel-ai/. 

@Waldemar ZnoinskiSince we don’t have access to source code (and many of these are older than versions we support), we will not be building any of them, and you will have to file for prodsec exemptions for any of them that are in use.  
You’ll have to use the history in the https://gitlab.com/redhat/rhel-ai/core/base-images/app
  (3.0 branch) to find the GPG keys associated with the mirrored RPMs

